; One diagnostic, from the descent — not from the head-set. `ghost` is a
; member of `:names`, so narrowing admitted it; the slot then had no form of
; that name to validate against. Attributed to the slot
; ([bind-group-layout entry]), which is the scope the lookup missed in.
(diagnostics
